type: software
title: "Aetherion: Flight Dynamics Library"
abstract: >-
  Aetherion is a research-grade C++ library for rocket and aerospace
  flight dynamics built on Featherstone 6-D spatial vector algebra,
  ECI/WGS84 frame transformations, algorithmic differentiation, and
  structure-preserving (Lie group) ODE integration, with FMI/FMU export
  for co-simulation. It is validated against the NASA/NESC
  six-degree-of-freedom flight simulation check cases
  (NASA TM-2015-218675).
